### Frontend environment example (Vite)
# Place at `frontend/.env` or in each frontend app root (e.g. `frontend/User/.env`)
# Vite requires variables to be prefixed with `VITE_` to be exposed to the client

# URL of the backend API (include protocol and port if needed)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Example additional client-side variables you might add:
# VITE_APP_TITLE=College Platform
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-public-anon-key

# Notes:
# - Never expose server-side secret keys in frontend env files. Only public keys (anon) are okay.